tile.beyondthestars.slCasing2.2.tooltip=The white inner face of the Kerr Ergosphere Engine (every arc and band; most of it in the T2 reinforcement),\nboth Kerr modules, the Homogeny and both Reality machines.\nMade in the Assembler (4 a craft), or 64 a craft in the Condensate Assembler.
