item.beyondthestars.kerrDensityUpgrade.tooltip=Upgrades a Kerr Ergosphere Engine from T1 to T2.\nCrafted in the Condensate Assembler (Bose-Einstein Condensate) with Entangled Raw Star Matter: Kerr T2 needs the Eye of Harmony running T1 first.
item.beyondthestars.starChartSol.tooltip=Eye of Harmony T1 target (Sol).\nCrafted in the Condensate Assembler (Bose-Einstein Condensate).
