# ---- SMBH v1: the Supermassive Lattice, the Event Horizon Crown, Conduit Throat Mk IV (smbh-v1.md §1, §3.4, §8.1) ----
beyondthestars.structure.quasar.lattice=The Supermassive Lattice is incomplete and the hole (over 4,096 SM) needs it: the quasar stays frozen until the lattice is whole (to take it down, lower the mass setpoint to 4,096 SM first)
# slCasing4 metas 0-5 (BlockSLCasing4)
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.0.name=Lattice Frame Casing
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.0.tooltip=The Supermassive Lattice round a Quasar Engine: its equatorial band, two latitude rings, struts and ribs (8,436 a lattice).\nThe lattice unlocks at Saturation (4,096 SM on MagMatter coils, Stable, for 1 hour).\nAssembler (UXV), 4 a craft.
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.1.name=Containment Node (L1, Superdense Ergomatter)
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.1.tooltip=48 per Supermassive Lattice, all one tier. L1: the hole is held up to 16,384 SM by the lattice alone,\nand up to 65,536 SM (the Eye T9 -> T10 Supermassive Link) with hold-up gas (4x the Eddington feed at the top).\nPower past 4,096 SM: x2 at 16,384 SM, x4 at 65,536 (about 3.9 x 10^17 EU/t). Assembly line, 8,000 L Superdense Ergomatter.
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.2.name=Containment Node (L2, White Hole Matter)
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.2.tooltip=48 per Supermassive Lattice, all one tier. L2: safe limit 65,536 SM, top 262,144 SM (held by gas above the safe limit).\nMade from an L1 node in the Condensate Assembler with Entangled White Hole Matter (Eye T9).
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.3.name=Containment Node (L3, Universium)
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.3.tooltip=48 per Supermassive Lattice, all one tier. L3: safe limit 262,144 SM, top 4,194,304 SM, and Overdrive:\nup to x100 (about 9.8 x 10^18 EU/t) for a while, burning Molten MHDCSM and Molten Universium.\nMade from an L2 node in the Condensate Assembler with Entangled Universium.
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.4.name=Containment Node (L4, Constrained Eternity)
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.4.tooltip=48 per Supermassive Lattice, all one tier. L4: safe limit 4,194,304 SM, top 67,108,864 SM, and Unbind:\npast the top, every doubling halves the Overdrive upkeep for a Primordial Matter anchor. Nothing is ever destroyed.\nMade from an L3 node in the Condensate Assembler: Eternity and MHDCSM plates, Universium coat.
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.5.name=Event Horizon Thermaliser Casing
tile.beyondthestars.slCasing4.5.tooltip=The Mk IV (Event Horizon) Burst Thermaliser Crown's core: 852 a crown, cap 524,288 Bu/t (5.2 x 10^18 EU/t).\nAssembler (UXV), 4 a craft.
item.beyondthestars.conduitThroatMk4.name=Conduit Throat Mk IV
item.beyondthestars.conduitThroatMk4.tooltip=Sits in a conduit element's controller like a turbine rotor (the Supermassive Lattice's throat).\nCarries up to 524,288 Bu/t (5.2 x 10^18 EU/t). Upkeep per element: 2 L/s Superdense Ergomatter (preferred),\nor 16 L/s Ergomatter, or 256 L/s Molten SpaceTime. Assembly line, from a Mk III with Superdense Ergomatter.
# ---- P4: the Einstein-Rosen Conduit (28121-28123), the Burst Thermaliser Crown (28124), the GRB Receptor Port (28125)
beyondthestars.structure.conduit.fuel=A Conduit element needs at least one Input Hatch in a throat-fuel socket (Molten SpaceTime, or Ergomatter after Eye T7)

