beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.dial=§eDIAL §7Each +0.25 costs 10 x 2^(N-1) L/s of Tachyon Rich Temporal Fluid. Cap 1 + 0.25 x (Time Dilation tier - N). − / + steps it (right-click: four steps); the screwdriver too.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.feed=§eFEED §7(T4) Each litre of HSM fed makes 3.6864 L of White Dwarf Matter x mean Y x r.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.rig=§eAUTOMATE §7A sensor past its threshold, then redstone, then a Fluid Regulator cover or an export bus with a redstone card, into a plain input hatch in a Field socket. Two sensors per two-sided gauge.
