beyondthestars.gui.homogeny.info.mix=§eMIX §7A mega mixer: Raw Star Matter 100 : 1 into Excited Stellar Plasma Mixture at T1, Degenerate Stellar Mixture at T2, Entanglement Medium (for Reality Diffraction) at T3. No overclock: each parallel draws the recipe's EU/t. No ignition, no maintenance.
beyondthestars.gui.homogeny.info.tiers=§eTIERS §7T1 (UMV) 1 parallel, T2 (UXV) 4, T3 (MAX) 16. The tier is the lower of the installed tier and the rings standing (the hologram's stack size builds rings 1..3).
beyondthestars.gui.homogeny.info.upgrade=§eUPGRADE §7Permanent. Build the next ring, mix %s L of this tier's product (ESPM, then Degenerate), right-click the next Homogeny Core onto the controller (sneak-punch returns it), then press Install.
beyondthestars.gui.homogeny.info.install=§eINSTALL §7%s min offline at %s (T2) / %s (T3) EU/t. A running mix finishes first; no new mix starts while installing. The screwdriver also starts it; a wrench keeps the progress.
beyondthestars.gui.homogeny.info.auto=§eAUTOMATE §7Feed hatches take ME input hatches; outputs go to ME output hatches.
