beyondthestars.gui.crown.info.power=§ePOWER §7A crown turns 1 Bu/t into 10^13 EU/t, straight onto the owner's wireless network. Caps: Mk I 32 Bu/t (3.2e14 EU/t), Mk II 512 (5.1e15), Mk III 8,192 (8.2e16, 82 quadrillion), Mk IV 524,288 Bu/t (5.2e18 EU/t, 5.2 quintillion).
beyondthestars.gui.crown.info.dock=§eDOCKING §7A crown takes a jet when its base centre sits on the quasar's port cell, the cell just past each cap on the jet axis: stand it on the top cap, hang it upside down under the bottom cap (wrench the controller's front to rotate it).
beyondthestars.gui.crown.info.stack=§eSTACKING §7A second crown stacked on the first takes the overflow over the lower crown's cap.
beyondthestars.gui.crown.info.receptor=§eRECEPTOR §7A GRB Receptor Port in the base takes a stream from the Conduit as well.
beyondthestars.gui.crown.info.auto=§eAUTOMATE §7OpenComputers: bts_crown. Nothing to set: the crown takes what arrives.
